\begin_inset Formula $C$
\end_inset

 (
\begin_inset Formula $S^{1}$
\end_inset

 is compact, an open interval is not). Instead we cover 
\begin_inset Formula $C$
\end_inset

 by (at least) two parametrized pieces 
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{1}(I_{1})$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{2}(I_{2})$
\end_inset

 which overlap (Figure
